Subject: WTF: Phoenix memory footprint from meminfo(); jsc MemoryFootprint() and --footprint

memoryFootprint() sums the anonymous pages of the process's map entries (meminfo(), as psh mem
does). libphoenix's struct rusage has no ru_maxrss, so FastMalloc statistics use it too, and the jsc
shell's MemoryFootprint()/--footprint report it (peak = largest value sampled).

